 "description": "Citation-pattern check for one query. Use this when the user has the pages an AI answer or Google AI Overview cited for a search and asks what they share, or why their own page is not cited. Pass query, cited_urls (2 to 6 public addresses the user copied from the answer) and exactly one of url, html or text for the user's page. Reads the public pages with robots.txt respected and returns the gaps first: each signal most cited pages share and the user's page lacks (opening answer, query words in a heading, question heading, table, list, date in the last year, links out, schema types, length), with counts such as 4 of 5 and a fix. Every signal is also listed per page. It reads no Google or AI engine, so the user must supply the cited addresses; never guess them. It stores nothing; change over days needs a new call later. A shared signal is a pattern in a small sample, not a proven cause, and no citation is promised. Do not use it for private addresses.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "anyOf": [
   {
    "required": [
     "url"
    ]
   },
   {
    "required": [
     "html"
    ]
   },
   {
    "required": [
     "text"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
   "cited_urls": {
    "description": "The public pages the AI answer cited, 2 to 6 addresses. Copy them by hand from the answer's source list; this tool does not read Google or any AI engine.",
    "items": {
     "description": "A public page address, such as https://example.com/best-form-builders. A bare domain means https.",
     "maxLength": 2048,
     "minLength": 3,
     "type": "string"
    },
    "maxItems": 6,
    "minItems": 2,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "html": {
    "description": "Your page as pasted HTML, for a draft that is not published. Nothing is fetched for it.",
    "maxLength": 200000,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "query": {
    "description": "The search or question the AI answer was given for, exactly as typed, such as \"best form builder\".",
    "maxLength": 200,
    "minLength": 3,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "text": {
    "description": "Your page as pasted text or Markdown.",
    "maxLength": 50000,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "url": {
    "description": "Your page to compare, a public address. Pass exactly one of url, html or text.",
    "maxLength": 2048,
    "minLength": 3,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "query",
   "cited_urls"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
